sequenceDiagram
    participant Agent
    participant Tool1 as kubectl_get_pods
    participant Tool2 as apply_manifest
    participant Context Window

    Agent->>Tool1: Get pods in namespace "kafka"
    Tool1->>Context Window: Store Result (25,000 tokens)
    Note over Context Window: Full pod JSON with metadata,<br/>status, conditions, etc.

    Agent->>Agent: Process result
    Agent->>Tool2: Apply manifest with pod data
    Tool2->>Context Window: Store Input (25,000 tokens duplicated)
    Note over Context Window: Same data written again

    Tool2->>Context Window: Store Result (15,000 tokens)
    Note over Context Window: Response with applied config

    Note over Context Window: Total: 25k + 25k + 15k = 65,000 tokens<br/>for a simple 2-step operation
